ge(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "185000"} "1900"] "\n" [:option {:value "185170"} "1956"] "\n" [:option {:value "185195"} "1960"] "\n" [:option {:value "185215"} "1964"] "\n" [:option {:value "185235"} "1968"] "\n" [:option {:value "185265"} "1972"] "\n" [:option {:value "185295"} "1976"] "\n" [:option {:value "185325"} "1980"] "\n" [:option {:value "185355"} "1984"] "\n" [:option {:value "185385"} "1988"] "\n" [:option {:value "185419"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "185457"} "1996"] "\n" [:option {:value "185498"} "2000"] "\n" [:option {:value "185544"} "2004"] "\n" [:option {:value "259104"} "2008"] "\n" [:option {:value "310013"} "2012"] "\n" [:option {:value "358434"} "2016"] "\n" [:option {:value "2003740"} "2024"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/270"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Individual, Open" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "3 –  4 August 2021"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/454"} "Baji Koen Equestrian Park, Setagaya, Tokyo"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/19012150"} "73 from 35 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "A much-simplified format was introduced for Tokyo. Thirty riders qualified (coincidentally exactly the number who avoided any jumping faults) from the competition on the Tuesday evening. Then, the following day, a single round of jumping was followed by a jump-off for the medals amongst those who rode faultless rounds. The qualifying round put paid to the chances of the entire American team and 2012 champion " [:a {:href "/athletes/107050"} "Steve Guerdat"] " (SUI), but most of the favourites progressed to the final without great difficulty."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Eight riders completed the final without knocking any of the fences over but, unfortunately for them, " [:a {:href ""} "Cian O’Connor"] " of Ireland and " [:a {:href "/athletes/125493"} "Scott Brash"] " of Great Britain missed the fight for the medals by finishing 0.4 seconds each over the required time. Of the six that did reach the jump-off, three were from the World Championship silver medal winning team from Sweden and one each from the Netherlands, Great Britain, and Japan."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The first three to go in the jump-off all went clear and all improved their predecessor’s time, but then Great Britain’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/116714"} "Ben Maher"] " and the nimble footed Explosion W edged ahead of " [:a {:href "/athletes/11981"} "Peder Fredricson"] " by only 0.17 of a second. The last two could not improve on Maher and Fredricson, although " [:a {:href "/athletes/125696"} "Maikel van der Vleuten"] " did edge out " [:a {:href "/athletes/121652"} "Henrik von Eckermann"] " to win bronze."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "Horse"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Qualifying"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {} "Jump-Off"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "341"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/116714"} "Ben Maher"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/4156"} "Explosion W"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "0 (=1)"] [:td {} "0 (1)"] [:td {} "0 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "387"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/11981"} "Peder Fredrics